// Properties: `verify` explores random walks of taps (and stores it makes up) and checks these
// after every step. (A stored `who` can be anything; the root's `me` clamps it, which a
// property can't read, since it depends on the board.)

after "cancel" "cancel only clears the guard's question"
  only writes pendingKey

after "setWho" "choosing a caregiver logs nothing"
  only writes who
